+"""Experiment 5860: bounded game-blind active observation A/B.
+
+Spec refs: REQ-ARC-WMTE-5860,
+SCENARIO-ARC-WMTE-5860-TAPE-IS-AGENT-OWNED,
+SCENARIO-ARC-WMTE-5860-BUDGET-PARITY-AND-READY-GATE,
